---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

const lastUpdated = 'August 12, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Terms of Use — ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`Terms of use for ${SITE.name}, a free browser-based ambient sound mixer.`}
  path="/terms"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6" data-focus-hide>
   <div class="glass px-6 py-8 sm:px-10 sm:py-10">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-extralight tracking-wide text-text">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-text-faint">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      By using {SITE.name} (the "Service"), you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please
      don't use the Service.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Use of the Service</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      The Service is provided free of charge for personal, non-commercial use. You may not use it
      in a way that infringes on the rights of others, disrupts the Service, or attempts to extract
      or redistribute its underlying code or audio assets for resale.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">No warranty</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      The Service is provided "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any kind, express
      or implied. {SITE.name} is a relaxation and focus aid, not a medical device or treatment, and
      makes no claims about therapeutic or medical benefits.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} and its operators are not liable for any
      indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of, or inability to use,
      the Service.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Third-party content and ads</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      The Service may display third-party advertisements. We are not responsible for the content
      of, or your interactions with, any third-party ads or linked sites.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Changes to the Service or these terms</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      We may modify or discontinue the Service at any time, and may update these terms
      occasionally. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the
      updated terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      Questions about these terms? Visit the
      <a href="/contact" class="text-accent underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2">contact page</a>.
    </p>
   </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
